div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Blood is normally useless (except for keeping us alive), only has use in some quests. You can get it by 'using' a liquid Container on a monster corpse who is not undead or invertebrate. For example, you won't get blood from <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">skeletons</a>, but you will get blood from <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">hunters</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">bears</a>.\nItem used in <a href=\"#/quest/the-pits-of-inferno-quest\">The Pits of Inferno Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/the-queen-of-the-banshees-quest\">The Queen of the Banshees Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a> and <a href=\"#/quest/unnatural-selection-quest\">Unnatural Selection Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandra\">Sandra</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">15 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbo